    - rid: 3046478613006778505
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: D-Dimitri did that? Wait... does that mean that.. you already
          know...?
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478613006778497
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3084.9995, y: 483.62622}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 25498427
          Part2: 1280493627
          Part3: 3783965373
          Part4: 250499973
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478613006778506
      type: {class: DialogueNodeCondition, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        conditionName: 
        unlockIfTrue: 1
        targetDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a773ed4246aac92468382da365a215cc, type: 2}
        isTalkDialogueNode:
          dialogueText: 'How the... *sigh* I knew the code was too easy to guess.

            Oh,
            well, at least it wasn''t <b>him</b> who figured it out.

            So
            what''s your deal? Are you a reporter? A spy? An officer? What should
            I do with you?'
          characterEmotion: 2
          characterReaction: 0
          doesItProveAnything: 4
          isKey: 0
          responses:
          - rid: 3046479065253413074
          - rid: 3046479065253413075
          - rid: 3046479065253413076
          isRootNode: 1
          editorPosition: {x: -67.000015, y: 205.40004}
          altDialoguePaths:
          - rid: 3046479065253413077
          - rid: 3046479065253413078
          guid:
            Part1: 3525925680
            Part2: 1233886507
            Part3: 990331288
            Part4: 3350988576
          tag: 
    - rid: 3046478613006778507
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'What? That... doesn''t make any sense.

          Unless...
          oh no, was he scolding me for not doing my research properly?

          I
          swear i found everything I could about that guy... wait... I mean... science!
          We''re scientist doing research, that''s what I meant... um... yeah.'
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478613006778502
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3102.5059, y: 810.482}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 209685302
          Part2: 1101052138
          Part3: 4035769758
          Part4: 1513944887
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478613006778508
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'So he DID get a <b>third</b> member for the team! I knew it!

          See,
          I told him that a mission like this would require more hands, but he was
          too proud to admit that I was right.

          I respect him a lot, he
          was like a... weird, creepy father to me... but, man, a <b>figure that
          important</b> could not go down without help... '
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478613006778498
        - rid: 3046478613006778499
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3936.9995, y: 483.62622}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2952297999
          Part2: 1079059291
          Part3: 637297305
          Part4: 4184934732
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478613006778509
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "So far, so good. The <b>target</b> has already gone upstairs,
          and the door sign says it's unlocked, so it should be easy to get him to
          fall for the <b>trap</b>. \nI've been really nice to everyone and no-one
          seens to suspect a thing.\nIf things keep going as planned, I'll be in
          there right before dinner, ready to <b>complete the task</b>..."
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478613006778501
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5161, y: 318}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 956334448
          Part2: 1168707074
          Part3: 985916342
          Part4: 2167441247
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478613006778510
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "\"The thing\"? Sorry, I don't think I know what that's supposed
          to mean.\nMan... are you guys already coming up with secret words without
          me? \nDamn it, I thought this would be the one place where I wouldn't feel
          <b>left out</b>..."
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478613006778500
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5170, y: 593}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2954009479
          Part2: 1319509012
          Part3: 1419098807
          Part4: 1616786135
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478908010004709
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: Hey, welcome back! Did you find the code yet?
        condition:
          dialogueText: '...getting into my room, I''m afraid.

            The thing
            is this "game" was mostly just a way to punish me for taking so long
            to arrive.

            He got to set the code of the room before I got
            here, and now he''s asking me to figure it out for myself.

            Which
            is why I''m asking for help, if you don''t mind.'
          characterEmotion: 0
          characterReaction: 0
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses:
          - rid: 3046478613006778489
          - rid: 3046478613006778490
          isRootNode: 0
