    - rid: 3046479065253413067
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Can I be of any help?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 3046479065253413070
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1879, y: -13.108383}
    - rid: 3046479065253413068
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, you''re the first and only person to come into this
          room, and the door to "the place" is still closed, so nothing''s gone wrong
          so far.

          Though, of course, I didn''t account on you being a
          part of this so, please don''t get in the way.

          This is a very
          serious business for me, alright?'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479065253413071
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -573.1084}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2757100495
          Part2: 1337091679
          Part3: 2331423645
          Part4: 1363973298
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479065253413069
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Then do me a favour and remind him that I said MANY TIMES
          that I would be the one taking care of that.

          And make sure that
          he keeps in mind that he''s in debt with me, and that he''s still <b>alive</b>
          for a reason.'
        characterEmotion: 3
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479065253413072
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -284.10843}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 3989213569
          Part2: 1292918822
          Part3: 1822912920
          Part4: 1958942294
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479065253413070
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...Please tell me you''re joking. There must have been a good
          reason for Oleg to let you in, and clearly your intelligence is not it.

          Look,
          just... stay out of this, alright? Clearly you''re not very well prepared,
          and you could easily get caught in the crossfire, so it''s better if you
          don''t get involved.'
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479065253413073
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2213, y: -13.108383}
