    - rid: 3046479065253413078
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: "Did you forget something? \nCome on, this is no time to be
          fooling around. If you need something, ask, quickly."
        condition:
          dialogueText: 'So he trusts you, then. And yet he felt like he had no reason
            to tell me about you.

            Seriously, why do i seem to be the
            only one who knows how to do my job properly?

            Ok, so then
            you must have come here looking for something. Be quick.'
          characterEmotion: 1
          characterReaction: 6
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses:
