          Part1: 86385421
          Part2: 1187369203
          Part3: 2302744214
          Part4: 3982707328
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479065253413080
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'No shit. And he sent you, a complete stranger, all the way
          here to find the code and tell me that?

          The kid''s ability to
          either be the biggest idiot or the most accidental genius will never cease
          to surprise me.

          Listen, I don''t know who you are, and luckily,
          you seem to be confused, so it''s probably best if you stay out of this.

          And
          don''t tell him about the code. He... didn''t earn it, let''s say.'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479065253413082
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1100.7, y: 309.81955}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2855662127
          Part2: 1111791029
          Part3: 3840308662
          Part4: 1349355998
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479065253413081
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'What else, then? The world''s best guesser? A time traveler?
          A detective with a magical notebook?

          I have no time for jokes,
          much less for you. I''ll pretend you didn''t just intrude, for you own
          safety, so <b>leave</b>.'
        characterEmotion: 3
